00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Okay. Awesome. Yeah, I just have my teammate, Fallon, here today. She's just kind of, like, observing things. Um, so yeah, she'll just be kind of in the background, but yeah. Um, yeah, how are you today, Shannon?

