00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Uh, okay.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Ready to cool down a little bit. Yeah, I know what you mean.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:21.000
Shannon Lee: Ready to get out of the heat.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:32.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, no, that makes sense. That makes sense. Okay, so basically, just I'm going to overview the whole VIP experience. So what you're getting today and then past today.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:49.000
